# SHOWSTOPPER: stage I's foes. Gumdrops creep at her; lanterns let out
# fireballs that home in a while; jesters stroll and fire three-shot fans;
# bats wait behind windows and swoop when she comes near; wall guns fire
# at her; snowballs hop at her.
game showstopper
wait 5
cheat run
cheat arena
cheat god
cheat spawn gumdrop 168 3076
wait 120
expect foe0_y > 3096
cheat clear
cheat spawn lantern 168 3076
cheat foet 0 149
wait 2
expect eb_9 == 1
cheat clear
cheat spawn jester 168 3076
cheat foet 0 49
wait 2
expect eb_0 == 3
cheat clear
cheat spawn wall_gun 100 3076
cheat foet 0 109
wait 2
expect eb_0 == 1
cheat clear
cheat spawn snowball 168 3076
wait 60
expect foe0_y > 3086
cheat clear
cheat spawn bat 100 3076
wait 30
expect foe0_y > 3086
cheat clear
